    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750640/extras/710ba719880782b4ea4ee6eb0ea78809.webp?t=1735727912\" /></div><br>Congratulations! You're on your way to becoming a professional agony aunt! All you have to do now is get through the trial period. Respond to messages from a diverse cast of characters using a retro 2006 email client. The replies you send will determine whether you are hired or fired at the end of the week. Good luck!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750640/extras/ca4d3ee67688d3a239ef85f6f067f677.webp?t=1735727912\" /></div><br>- wholesome storytelling delivered entirely through emails<br>- a British magazine that may or may not hire you as their new agony aunt<br>- a diverse cast of 24 characters, each with their own unique problem to solve<br>- two possible outcomes for every character, determined by the choices you make<br>- over 15,000 words and over 80 emails to read<br>- short gameplay, approximately half an hour per playthrough<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750640/extras/38d46229a697f16f3fdb2c49c6aa9ad1.webp?t=1735727912\" /></div><br>Dear Agony Aunt is a love letter to the English language.",
